name: Jupiter — Flush level
author: corpus
description: >-
  Jupiter levels up Flush. First-shop Flush engine: stack with Droll Joker, Crafty Joker,
  The Tribe, and Smeared Joker.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - planetCard: Jupiter
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
